stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> ObservationDraft
 ObservationDraft --> PendingReview: Connected validation
 PendingReview --> Approved: Qualified scoped approval
 PendingReview --> Rejected: Reason recorded
 Approved --> Invalidated: Evidence changed or approval expired
 Invalidated --> PendingReview: Re-review
 Approved --> AttemptAuthorized: Recheck role, version and expiry
 AttemptAuthorized --> ReportedCompleted: Staff reports completion
 AttemptAuthorized --> ReportedFailed: Staff reports failure
 AttemptAuthorized --> OutcomeUnknown: Outcome uncertain
 OutcomeUnknown --> Reconciliation: Qualified review before a new action
 note right of ObservationDraft
 Offline capture only while grant valid
 end
 note right of OutcomeUnknown
 No automatic physical retry
 end
